{"changes":[{"location":"Policy Period End","change_type":"structured","description":"Policy period end date moved from July 16, 2026 to September 14, 2026, lengthening the policy term.","old":"07/16/2026","new":"September 14, 2026"},{"location":"Property Damage Liability Limit","change_type":"structured","description":"Property damage liability limit reduced from $100,000 to $25,000 each accident.","old":"$100,000 each accident","new":"$25,000 each accident"},{"location":"Uninsured/Underinsured Motorist Limit","change_type":"structured","description":"Uninsured/underinsured motorist limits reduced from $100,000/$300,000 to $25,000/$50,000.","old":"$100,000 each person / $300,000 each accident","new":"$25,000 each person / $50,000 each accident"},{"location":"Medical Payments Limit","change_type":"structured","description":"Medical payments limit reduced from $5,000 to $1,000 each person.","old":"$5,000 each person","new":"$1,000 each person"},{"location":"5.2","change_type":"clause","description":"Fraud exclusion narrowed. It previously applied to knowing concealment or misrepresentation. It now applies only to intentional misrepresentation, so concealment is no longer listed as grounds for denying coverage.","old":"We do not provide coverage for any insured who has knowingly concealed or misrepresented any material fact or circumstance in connection with this policy or a claim.","new":"We do not provide coverage for any insured who has intentionally misrepresented any material fact or circumstance in connection with this policy or a claim."},{"location":"3.3","change_type":"clause","description":"Comprehensive coverage for theft narrowed to theft of the entire vehicle only. Partial theft, such as stolen parts or contents, is no longer included among the listed covered causes.","old":"We will pay for direct and accidental loss to your covered auto not caused by collision, including fire, theft, vandalism, flood, and contact with animals, less the applicable deductible shown in the Declarations.","new":"We will pay for direct and accidental loss to your covered auto not caused by collision, including fire, theft of the entire vehicle, vandalism, flood, and contact with animals, less the applicable deductible shown in the Declarations."},{"location":"4.2","change_type":"clause","description":"Scope of the excess-insurance provision for non-owned vehicles changed. 'or regularly use' was added, which changes which non-owned vehicles receive only excess coverage.","old":"Any insurance we provide for a vehicle you do not own is excess over any other collectible insurance.","new":"Any insurance we provide for a vehicle you do not own or regularly use is excess over any other collectible insurance."}]}
